Package: uzunyx-debinstall
Version: @VERSION@
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Maintainer: emi <285864120+antarest47@users.noreply.github.com>
Depends: apt, dpkg, sudo, konsole | x-terminal-emulator
Description: Install .deb packages from the file manager (Uzunyx)
 Adds «Install package» to the right-click menu of .deb files in Dolphin and
 on the desktop, and an «Open with» entry. It opens a terminal that shows the
 package and runs «sudo apt install ./package.deb», so apt resolves its
 dependencies and asks for the password as usual.
